  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 (performance-first): removes debug file logging from all hot paths (SELECT, parameterized ExecuteSQL, batch transactions, INSERT) that caused per-operation disk I/O and throttled point reads/updates/deletes. See docs/performance/V2_PERFORMANCE_PLAN.md for the v2.x performance roadmap: prepared/compiled query execution, allocation reduction, storage/index tuning, and C# 15 / .NET 11 readiness.",
